WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,780
Encirclement and Suppression No. 1 is too costly and the plan is postponed

2
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:04,820
As long as a large number of these gold boxes are defended

3
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:07,220
Only when the human camp has a better chance of winning can it truly make a comeback

4
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:08,620
Directed to all frontline combat teams

5
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:10,620
Mark the coordinates immediately after killing the plainclothes heel

6
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:12,820
All members of the quarantine team were dispatched to blockade and recover the bodies.

7
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:14,620
The streets have long been surrounded by nests of corpses

8
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:18,620
Without superpowers, you don’t even have the guts to step out of the inner door.

9
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:25,460
You did it on purpose

10
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:27,060
Do you need me to help you catch them?

11
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:28,660
After I'm captured, I can hand it over to you for processing.

12
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:32,730
Will he think that I am a cruel person twisted by hatred?

13
00:00:32,730 --> 00:00:36,820
In the last life, they personally killed my mother

14
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:38,220
Pushed down Gao Long

15
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:40,820
I can understand that it happened to you in the previous life

16
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:43,050
And I also experienced a betrayal in this life

17
00:00:43,050 --> 00:00:45,650
My enemy has been protected by the superpower base

18
00:00:45,650 --> 00:00:46,850
There are many experts there

19
00:00:46,850 --> 00:00:49,250
I haven't thought yet that I can take revenge and escape unscathed
